1.2.3
Why fitness testing is
important

Learners should know and understand why fitness testing is important
and the role fitness testing plays in improvement of performance.

The reasons for testing are to:
•  carry out comparisons against normative data
•

identify a performer’s strengths and weaknesses

•  provide a baseline for future comparisons
•  provide important information for the coach
•  provide information that assists in team selection
•

set goals or targets.

